#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps to use the Sampler primitive {#steps-to-use-the-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Mga hakbang para gamitin ang Sampler primitive {#steps-to-use-the-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. I-initialize ang account {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Because Qiskit Runtime is a managed service, you first need to initialize your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the expectation value.\n"
msgid "You first need to initialize your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "Dahil ang Qiskit Runtime ay isang managed na serbisyo, kailangan mo munang i-initialize ang iyong account. Maaari kang pumili ng QPU na gusto mong gamitin para kalkulahin ang expectation value.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) topic if you don't already have an account set up.\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang sa paksa ng [I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) kung wala ka pang naka-set up na account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga fractional gate\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use the newly supported [fractional gates](/guides/fractional-gates), set `use_fractional_gates=True` when requesting a backend from a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance. For example:\n"
msgstr "Para gamitin ang bagong sinusuportahang [mga fractional gate](/guides/fractional-gates), itakda ang `use_fractional_gates=True` kapag humihiling ng backend mula sa isang `QiskitRuntimeService` instance. Halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is an experimental feature and might change in the future.\n"
msgstr "Ito ay isang experimental na feature at maaaring magbago sa hinaharap.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Create a circuit {#2-create-a-circuit}"
msgstr "2. Lumikha ng circuit {#2-create-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit as the input to the Sampler primitive.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan mo ng kahit isang circuit bilang input sa Sampler primitive.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit and observable need to be transformed to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuits). Use the transpiler to do this.\n"
msgstr "Ang circuit at observable ay kailangang i-transform para gumamit lamang ng mga tagubilin na sinusuportahan ng QPU (tinatawag na *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuit). Gamitin ang transpiler para gawin ito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "3. Initialize the Qiskit Runtime Sampler {#3-initialize-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler}"
msgid "3. Initialize the IBM Quantum Sampler {#3-initialize-the-ibm-quantum-sampler}"
msgstr "3. I-initialize ang Qiskit Runtime Sampler {#3-initialize-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "When you initialize Sampler, use the `mode` parameter to specify the mode you want it to run in.  Possible values are `batch`, `session`, or `backend` objects for batch, session, and job execution mode, respectively. For more information, see [Introduction to Qiskit Runtime execution modes.](execution-modes) Note that Open Plan users cannot submit session jobs.\n"
msgid "When you initialize Sampler, use the `mode` parameter to specify the mode you want it to run in.  Possible values are `batch`, `session`, or `backend` objects for batch, session, and job execution mode, respectively. For more information, see [Introduction to IBM Quantum Compute Service execution modes](/guides/execution-modes). Note that Open Plan users cannot submit session jobs.\n"
msgstr "Kapag ini-initialize mo ang Sampler, gamitin ang parameter na `mode` para tukuyin ang mode na gusto mong patakbuhin nito. Ang mga posibleng halaga ay mga object na `batch`, `session`, o `backend` para sa batch, session, at job execution mode, ayon sa pagkakasunod. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang [Panimula sa mga execution mode ng Qiskit Runtime.](execution-modes) Tandaan na ang mga gumagamit ng Open Plan ay hindi makakapagsumite ng mga session job.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Invoke Sampler and get results {#4-invoke-sampler-and-get-results}"
msgstr "4. I-invoke ang Sampler at makuha ang mga resulta {#4-invoke-sampler-and-get-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, invoke the `run()` method to generate the output. The circuit and optional parameter value sets are input as *primitive unified bloc* (PUB) tuples.\n"
msgstr "Susunod, i-invoke ang method na `run()` para makabuo ng output. Ang circuit at mga opsyonal na set ng halaga ng parameter ay inilalagay bilang mga tuple ng *primitive unified bloc* (PUB).\n"

